                                          "args": {
                                            "text": [
                                              "Which improvement\nbudget can be\npromised without\ntaking tokens from\nbasic service? The",
                                              "same budget\napplies to every\nemphasis. It\ndefines the honest\namount any of the",
                                              "three proposals\nmay spend first.\nPip will read the\nfigure before the\nribbon, because an",
                                              "inspiring proposal\nis still a promise\nsomebody must be\nable to keep."
                                            ],
