                                                "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                                "args": {
                                                  "text": [
                                                    "Which combined\nresponse applies\nthe demonstrated\nsafeguards? HOLD\nmeans shut every",
                                                    "branch and wait\nfor a perfect\nsystem. PUSH means\nincrease pressure\nand assume the",
                                                    "message arrived.\nSERVE means keep\nclear branches at\nsafe service,\nretain lodge",
                                                    "isolation, and\nsend the backup\ncopy by the\navailable foot\nroute. Choose the",
                                                    "plan you can\nexplain to the\nwaiting residents."
                                                  ],
